    "synopsis": {
        "native": "\u00c0 partir de leur rencontre \u00e0 Chartres en 1939, l\u2019histoire d\u2019amour de Lucienne, vendeuse chez Gallimard, et de Simon, \u00e9tudiant am\u00e9ricain. Un amour sur fond de Grande Histoire, la fin de la guerre d\u2019Espagne, la guerre contre le nazisme. Une histoire qui fait des allers-retours entre la France et l\u2019Am\u00e9rique. Lucienne et Simon, devenus personnages de fiction sous la plume d\u2019un \u00e9crivain, Marie Nimier\u2026 mes parents.",
        "english": "From their first encounter in Chartres in 1939, the love affair between Lucienne, a shop assistant at Gallimard, and Simon, an American student, unfolds. It's a love story set against historic moments, the end of the Spanish Civil War, the war against Nazism. It's a story that travels between France and America. Lucienne and Simon, who've become fictional characters through Marie Nimier, a writer. They are my parents."
